Derived files (package ee.extras.wire and ee.extras.mixin.WireRaycastMixin) carry a note in their class
comment saying which Power Grid classes they come from and what was changed. Main changes: Power Grid's
electrical simulation replaced with Electro Energetics wires; Sable, Architectury and Registrate removed;
NeoForge networking; branch nodes stored as Electro Energetics detached nodes; support check added.
The junction box shape follows powergrid:cord_junction.

Distributed under the Apache License 2.0 terms for the derived parts; the rest of the addon is MIT.

The PCB component models and textures (assets/ee_extras/{models,textures}/block/pcb_part)
are adapted from Create: Power Grid, revision e22874b, Copyright 2025-2026 patryk3211,
under the Apache License, Version 2.0. The models were rescaled and recentered for the
EE Extras board grid, and texture paths were changed to the EE Extras namespace.

The PCB light glow layer uses the light_bulb texture from Create: Power Grid, revision e22874b,
under Apache-2.0. The glow geometry was adapted to flat panels and independent strip sections.
Small PCB LEDs reference Electro Energetics' installed indicator models at runtime; no EE assets are redistributed.
